Broadcom b43 firmware 6.30.163.46

This package contains firmware extracted from Broadcom's proprietary driver
object broadcom-wl-6.30.163.46.wl_apsta.o. That object ships by itself, with
no license text. Broadcom has not contributed this firmware to linux-firmware.

The files are produced at build time with b43-fwcutter, which is the
extraction the kernel's b43 documentation describes. The blob's SHA-256 is
pinned in the PKGBUILD.
